    {
      "id": "55043",
      "entry": {
        "title": "ITEM_CFA-L1-08935",
        "feedback": {},
        "itemBody": "<p>For a floating-rate note, the specified yield spread over the reference rate <i>best </i>defines the:</p>",
        "properties": {
          "shuffleRules": {
            "choices": {
              "toLock": [],
              "shuffled": false
            }
          },
          "varyPointsByAnswer": false
        },
        "scoringData": {
          "value": "914b9172-ccd9-4599-9211-86288bb88059"
        },
        "answerFeedback": {
          "1871d6af-5835-444a-a932-b9c184ab4dce": "<p>Incorrect because a specified yield spread is added to, or subtracted from, the reference rate which results in the coupon. For example, the floater might reset its interest rate quarterly at the reference rate&nbsp;plus 0.50%. This is not the quoted margin, it is the reference rate plus the quoted margin.&nbsp;</p>",
          "593b542a-3706-4c08-bf64-74a8396859b3": "<p>Incorrect because the required margin is the yield spread over, or under, the reference rate such that the FRN is priced at par value on a rate reset date. Changes in the required margin usually come from changes in the issuer's credit risk.&nbsp;The required margin is not specified but changes based on market forces.&nbsp;</p>",
          "914b9172-ccd9-4599-9211-86288bb88059": "<p>Correct because this specified yield spread over the reference rate is called the quoted margin on the FRN. The role of the quoted margin is to compensate the investor for the difference in the credit risk of the issuer and that implied by the reference rate.</p>"
        },
        "calculatorType": "none",
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "1871d6af-5835-444a-a932-b9c184ab4dce",
              "itemBody": "<p>A. coupon.</p>",
              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "914b9172-ccd9-4599-9211-86288bb88059",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. quoted margin.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "593b542a-3706-4c08-bf64-74a8396859b3",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. required margin.</p>",
              "position": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "scoringAlgorithm": "Equivalence",
        "interactionTypeSlug": "choice"
      },
      "status": "mutable",
      "archived": false,
      "position": 2,
      "entryType": "Item",
      "properties": {},
