    {
      "id": "55044",
      "entry": {
        "title": "ITEM_CFA-L1-2020-C2-FI-Groenning-18",
        "feedback": {},
        "itemBody": "<p>A commercial paper has the following characteristics:</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Redemption value</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">$5,000,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interest earned</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">$140,500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Days to maturity</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">160</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>For a 365-day year, the discount rate is <i>closest</i> to:</p>",
        "properties": {
          "shuffleRules": {
            "choices": {
              "toLock": [],
              "shuffled": false
            }
          },
          "varyPointsByAnswer": false
        },
        "scoringData": {
          "value": "ec6996db-fa54-4a99-a6f2-b8fbed12e6b6"
        },
        "answerFeedback": {
          "9086e9e7-ce56-4e57-9ad1-cdf6424565b2": "<p>Incorrect because this is the&nbsp;add-on rate. AOR =&nbsp;Year/Days&nbsp;× ((FV – PV)/PV)&nbsp;</p><p>AOR&nbsp;=&nbsp;(365/160)&nbsp;× (140,500/(5,000,000 – 140,500))&nbsp;= 0.0660&nbsp;≈ 6.6%.&nbsp;</p>",
          "97c7590f-887f-4125-bab3-ba31750d2fe9": "<p>Incorrect because candidates confuse the redemption value with the present value and thereby add&nbsp;the interest earned to the redemption value as part of the calculation.</p><p>DR&nbsp;≠&nbsp;(365/160)&nbsp;× (140,500/(5,000,000 + 140,500)) = 0.0624&nbsp;≈ 6.2%.&nbsp;</p>",
          "ec6996db-fa54-4a99-a6f2-b8fbed12e6b6": "<p>Correct because&nbsp;the discount rate,&nbsp;DR =&nbsp;(Year/Days)&nbsp;× ((FV – PV)/FV), where Year = number of days in the year, Days = number of days between settlement and maturity, FV = future value paid at maturity/face value of&nbsp;the money market instrument,&nbsp;PV = present value/price of the money market instrument, and <i>FV</i><i> – </i><i>PV</i>, is the interest earned.</p><p>DR = (365/160)&nbsp;× (140,500/5,000,000) = 0.0641&nbsp;≈ 6.4%.&nbsp;</p>"
        },
        "calculatorType": "none",
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "97c7590f-887f-4125-bab3-ba31750d2fe9",
              "itemBody": "<p>A. 6.2%.</p>",
              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "ec6996db-fa54-4a99-a6f2-b8fbed12e6b6",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. 6.4%.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "9086e9e7-ce56-4e57-9ad1-cdf6424565b2",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. 6.6%.</p>",
              "position": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "scoringAlgorithm": "Equivalence",
        "interactionTypeSlug": "choice"
      },
      "status": "mutable",
