    {
      "id": "55045",
      "entry": {
        "title": "ITEM_Copy of CFA-L1-04317   ",
        "feedback": {},
        "itemBody": "<p>A floating-rate note makes semiannual interest payments and has a coupon rate equal to the six-month market reference rate plus 45 basis points. The interest payments are made in June and December. If the six-month market reference rate was 1.95% in June and 2.25% in December of the same&nbsp;year, the coupon rate paid in December of that year&nbsp;was <i>closest</i> to:</p>",
        "properties": {
          "shuffleRules": {
            "choices": {
              "toLock": [],
              "shuffled": false
            }
          },
          "varyPointsByAnswer": false
        },
        "scoringData": {
          "value": "71b94143-d9d0-44db-b236-5eb2df27700b"
        },
        "answerFeedback": {
          "2f54fcbf-8205-4364-b5d5-3a945c0a7054": "<p>Incorrect because the 45 bps margin is added to the average of the June and December six-month market reference rates = (2.25% + 1.95%) / 2 + 0.45% = 2.55%.</p>",
          "71b94143-d9d0-44db-b236-5eb2df27700b": "<p>Correct because the applicable interest rate in December is the six-month market reference rate in June plus the 45 basis point margin = 1.95% + 0.45% = 2.40%.</p>",
          "d1164b25-19cf-4c4a-a655-e763ed39db3b": "<p>Incorrect because the 45 bps margin is added to the market reference rate in December = 2.25% + 0.45% = 2.70%.</p>"
        },
        "calculatorType": "none",
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "71b94143-d9d0-44db-b236-5eb2df27700b",
              "itemBody": "<p>A. 2.40%.</p>",
              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "2f54fcbf-8205-4364-b5d5-3a945c0a7054",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. 2.55%.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "d1164b25-19cf-4c4a-a655-e763ed39db3b",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. 2.70%.</p>",
              "position": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "scoringAlgorithm": "Equivalence",
        "interactionTypeSlug": "choice"
      },
      "status": "mutable",
