      "entry": {
        "title": "CFA2438-R-s03-Q12",
        "feedback": {
          "correct": "",
          "neutral": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">B is correct. The FRN is priced at 99.804 per 100 of par value. Using the information provided, the periodic <em>PMT</em> is equal to</p>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___31\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mo>(</mo> <mi>M</mi> <mi>R</mi> <mi>R</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mi>Q</mi> <mi>M</mi> <mo>)</mo> <mo>×</mo> <mi>F</mi> <mi>V</mi> </mrow> <mi>m</mi> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>=</mo> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mo>(</mo> <mn>0.025</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>0.008</mn> <mo>)</mo> <mo>×</mo> <mn>100</mn> </mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0.825.</mn> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">The assumed discount rate per period is equal to 0.875%.</p>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___32\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mi>r</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mi>M</mi> <mi>R</mi> <mi>R</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mi>D</mi> <mi>M</mi> </mrow> <mi>m</mi> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>.</mo> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___33\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mi>r</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>0.025</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>0.01</mn> </mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>.</mo> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___34\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mi>r</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0.00875.</mn> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">To value this FRN, take the present value of each cash flow using the discount rate per period. The FRN is priced at 99.804 per 100 of par value.</p>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___35\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semanti