          "correct": "",
          "neutral": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">C is correct. The bond equivalent yield is closest to 0.56%.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">The present value of the banker’s certificate of deposit is calculated as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___37\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mi>P</mi> <mi>V</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mi>F</mi> <mi>V</mi> <mo>×</mo> <mo>(</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>−</mo> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>Days</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>Year</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>×</mo> <mi>D</mi> <mi>R</mi> <mo>)</mo> <mo>.</mo> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___38\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mi>P</mi> <mi>V</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>100</mn> <mo>×</mo> <mo>(</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>−</mo> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>90</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>360</mn> </mrow> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>×</mo> <mn>0.0055</mn> <mo>)</mo> <mo>.</mo> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___39\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mi>P</mi> <mi>V</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>99.865.</mn> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">The bond equivalent yield (AOR using a 365-day year) is calculated to be approximately 0.56%:</p>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___40\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\"><math><semantics> <mrow> <mi>A</mi> <mi>O</mi> <mi>R</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>Year</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>Days</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>×</mo> <mstyle><mfrac> <mrow> <mi>F</mi> <mi>V</mi> <mo>−</mo> <mi>P</mi> <mi>V</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mi>P</mi> <mi>V</mi> </mrow> </mfrac></mstyle> <mo>.</mo> </mrow> </semantics></math></div>\n<div id=\"CFA2438-R-s03-E___41\" style=\"margin-left: 1.618em; o