        "itemBody": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">A 91-day UK gilt (Treasury bill) has a face value of GBP2 million, a discount rate of 0.25%, and a price of GBP1.9 million. If a year has 366 days, the discount rate for the UK gilt is closest to: </p>",
